plot3d(m.hist, "Histogram", "bars3d", "#8866ff", "separate", 2)`},{name:"RSI Scatter",description:"RSI values as colored 3D scatter plot — overbought/oversold regions visible by color gradient",category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// RSI 3D Scatter — point cloud + trend ribbon through it
